* moveq of a number 128..255 plus an external (moveq #$80+Ext1,d1): r68 takes the byte (a byte
* reference to Ext1-$80), gas refused $80 as out of range.
* fixed: 4dc4e3b 2026-10-11 r68togas: moveq of a number 128..255 plus an external
* expect text: 72007400 4e714e71
 psect moveq_high_ext,0,0,0,0,0
 moveq #$80+Ext1,d1
 moveq #200-Ext,d2
 nop
 ends
